<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Altera said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Altera said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney upgraded Altera Corp to buy from outperform, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Analyst not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 2-7/8 to 56-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
